    LOG FORMAT: [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS] --  \r\n\r\n[1985-06-05 05:03:18]  \r\nNOTE:
    Team Alpha departing for scheduled supply run to Depot 3.  \r\nConditions: Clear
    skies, wind calm, ambient temp -41.2\xB0C.  \r\nEstimated return: ~3 hours. 
    \r\n"
  - "[1985-06-05 05:47:09]  \r\nMSG FROM FIELD UNIT A1:  \r\n\"Unusual patterns in
    snow near snowcat treads. Circular, partially melted.  \r\nRequesting photo log
    and forwarding samples if possible.\"  \r\n\r\n[1985-06-05 06:21:44]  \r\nMSG
    FROM FIELD UNIT A1:  \r\n\"Markings extend across south-side vehicle path.  \r\nUnclear
    origin. No local wildlife detected.  \r                                                                     
    Proceeding with caution.\"  \r\n"
  - "[1985-06-05 06:56:32]  \r\nWARNING: Rapid pressure drop detected.  \r\nBarometric
    reading fell 12 mb in under 7 minutes.  \r\nExternal wind gusts increasing. 
    \r\n"
  - "[1985-06-05 07:01:20]  \r\nURGENT MSG FROM FIELD UNIT A1:  \r\n\"Conditions
    turning fast. Visibility collapsing.  \r\nUnknown storm formation approaching
    from southwest quadrant.  \r\nAttempting immediate return to base. ETA uncertain.\" 
    \r\n"
  - "[1985-06-05 07:02:47]  \r\nSYSTEM NOTICE: Environmental instability detected. 
    \r\nWind telemetry exceeding safe recording threshold.  \r\nGenerator strain
    critical.  \r\n"
  - "[1985-06-05 07:02:51]  \r\n** RADIO LINK LOST  \r\n** SATELLITE TELEMETRY INTERRUPTED 
    \r\n** SENSOR ARRAY UNRESPONSIVE  \r\n\n[1985-06-05 07:02:55]  \r\nSYSTEM WARNING:
    Main power fluctuation  \r\n> Failing over to backup battery..."
  - "\r[1985-06-05 07:02:57]  \r\n*** CRITICAL ERROR: GENERATOR FAILURE  \r\n***
    SYSTEM SHUTDOWN INITIATED  \r\n\r\n[1985-06-05 07:02:59]  \r\n>>> TERMINAL OFFLINE
    <<<  \r\n\r\n--- END OF LOG ---  \r\n"
  - ">> ALERT: SATELLITE BAY INACTIVE  \r\n>> SATELLITE ARRAYS NOT POWERED OR ALIGNED 
    \r\n>> IMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED: PROCEED TO SATELLITE BAY FOR MANUAL ACTIVATION
    AND ALIGNMENT OF DISH ARRAYS  \r\n>> FAILURE TO ACTIVATE WILL RESULT IN LOSS
    OF EXTERNAL COMMUNICATIONS  \r\n>> RECOMMENDED: FOLLOW SAFETY PROTOCOLS DUE TO
    POTENTIAL EXTERNAL HAZARDS  "
  textDisplaySpeed: 0.05
  playerObject: {fileID: 1531318805}
  cameraObject: {fileID: 8125550157732971665}
  startAudioSource: {fileID: 1256345913}
  endAudioSource: {fileID: 1256345913}
  fadeDuration: 1
  startAudioMaxVolume: 0.3
